  "goodToKnow": "Der Staatsstreich is a coup d'état; der Putsch is a synonym that came from Swiss German into English. German history knows the right-wing Kapp-Putsch (1920), defeated by a general strike, Hitler's failed Munich putsch (1923), and the officers' plot of 20 July 1944 to kill Hitler. In December 2022, police arrested members of a Reichsbürger group accused of planning a coup. Plural: die Staatsstreiche."
